          "id": 2640588103,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "Thanks for your efforts to improve DNP3 dissection, but as noted above, the policy on committing changes to release branches is bugfixes only.  For info on the release policy see [here](https://wiki.wireshark.org/Development/ReleasePolicy).\n\nThe change has a number of items that I would not class as bugfixes, e.g. conversations, taps.\n\nMy personal preference would have been to make each distinct change, e.g. the double bit changes, as a separate MR to allow easier review.",
