        {
          "id": 2641490909,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "Ah, I do concede that the conversations and taps change is probably more of an enhancement than a bugfix. (I mistakenly thought that it was part of what John did on Nov 6 to fix my long-open issues.)\n\nDo you want me to go through the commits to this file, identify which are bug fixes and which are enhancements, and then only merge request the bug fixes (one at a time) to the release-4.4 branch?\n\nI can do that, but now that I found the automated builds for master, I can definitely tell my colleagues to use that instead. Do we know when the DNP3 changes will make it into a release branch naturally? 4.5? 5.0?",
