      "parent_ids": [
        "9ac6b0675f9703ca45d1109ff4b91338e0d2f68d"
      ],
      "title": "DNP3: Check for null TVB returned by process_reassembled_data",
      "message": "DNP3: Check for null TVB returned by process_reassembled_data\n\nIf the reassembly was completed, we can always call\nprocess_reassembled_data. If it returns a non-null TVB,\ncall the dissector. If it returns a null TVB, it was\nreassembled in another frame.\n\nPing #20336\n",
      "author_name": "John Thacker",
      "author_email": "johnthacker@gmail.com",
      "authored_date": "2025-01-14T08:47:45.000-05:00",
